<title>CANADA: Kingsway shareholders approve stock split.</title>
<headline>Kingsway shareholders approve stock split.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingsway Financial Services Inc said on Friday that its shareholders approved a two-for-one split of the company's shares.</p>
<p>Kingsway said in a statement that the stock split was approved at a special meeting earlier today.</p>
<p>The share division will be for shareholders of record on October 25.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
